      "quote": "八年丁丑正月壬午，英宗復皇帝位，改天順元年。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "content/books/mingshi/vol-011/from-start/part-08/sources/mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p001699/source.txt",
      "raw_sha256": "230b65e1bf5deec5630dc9967fe8f4ba8358851d78bd15d3fe29ef252a93a2b1",
      "quote": "壬午，武清侯石亨、副都御史徐有貞等迎上皇復位"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "content/books/mingshi/vol-012/from-start/part-01/sources/mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p001714/source.txt",
      "raw_sha256": "62671a10f99143e02691785422d75eb722d734ccb8b9d9c20233af1e083aa5e1",
      "quote": "日中，御奉天殿即位。"
    },
    {
      "raw_path": "content/books/mingshi/vol-012/from-start/part-01/sources/mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p001714/source.txt",
      "raw_sha256": "62671a10f99143e02691785422d75eb722d734ccb8b9d9c20233af1e083aa5e1",
      "quote": "丙戌，詔赦天下，改景泰八年為天順元年。"
    }
  ],
